  {
   "metric": "AUM",
   "statement": "We are confident of a 20% to 24% AUM growth in FY27.",
   "quote": "In terms of AUM, we're confident of a 20% to 24% AUM growth, aided by new businesses that we've launched in the last few years as they begin to scale.",
